    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present 7 College Square, Terenure to the open market. A very fine modern semi-detached family home c. 2002 Sq.Ft / 186 Sq.M.\r\n\r\nSituated within this much sought after development, wonderfully positioned overlooking communal green to front with ample off-street parking, low maintenance garden and side entrance.\r\n\r\nFull of natural light with excellent layout and a home providing all the comforts required for modern day living.\r\n\r\nComprising hall with w.c., whb. Lounge with marble mantlepiece and gas stove, alcove units with cupboards and shelving, doors to large open plan kitchen/dining with extensive range of units, island unit and patio door to rear. There is a utility off.\r\n\r\nOn the first floor are two bedrooms to rear both with fitted wardrobes and one en-suite. Bedroom 3 to front and family bathroom. On the second-floor bedroom 4 has fitted wardrobe and en-suite showerroom. Bedroom 5 to front has fitted wardrobes x2, doors to balcony and ensuite jacuzzi bath, w.c., whb.\r\n\r\nOutside is parking, rear garden, side entrance. The property is beside a wide range of schools including St.Pius, St. Joseph’s, Presentation, Terenure and Templeogue Colleges, Our Lady’s etc. There are a variety of sports facilities including GAA, Rugby, Templeogue Tennis Club etc. Bushy Park, Terenure Village and Rathfarnham Shopping Centre are nearby as are, bus routes and the M50."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nSolid wood floor, Ceiling coving. W.c., whb. Tiled floor, double doors to:\r\n\r\nLounge\r\nMarble mantlepiece with gas fire stove. Alcove units with cupboards and shelving. Solid wood floor. Ceiling coving. Folding doors to:\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining\r\nRange of wall units and floor units with marble worktop. Sink unit. Extractor. Plumbed for dishwasher. Island unit with marble worktop, drawers. Built in dresser with glazed doors. Shelving, cupboards. Recessed lights. Ceramic tiled floor. 3x Velux windows. Sliding patio door to rear.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\nPlumbed for washing machine. C.H Boiler. Fitted press. \r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n1st Floor\r\nBedroom 1 (Rear)\r\nFitted wardrobe. Laminate floor. Ensuite rainfall and telephone shower. W.c.,whb with marble top. Cupboards. Recessed lights.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Rear)\r\nFitted wardrobe. Laminate floor.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nBath, Rainfall shower, w.c.,whb. Marble top, cupboards. Medicine cabinets, part tiled. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (Front)\r\nLaminate floor. Recessed lights.\r\n\r\n2nd Floor\r\nBedroom 4 (Rear)\r\nFitted wardrobe. Laminate floor. Rainfall and telephone shower, w.c., whb with marble top, towel shelf, shelved closets. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 (Front)\r\nFitted wardrobes x2. Laminate floor. Recessed lights. Glazed doors to balcony. Ensuite jacuzzi bath, rainfall and telephone shower, w.c.,whb with marble top. Shelved closets, recessed lights. Tiled.\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nWater cylinder/airing cupboard.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nCobblelock parking to front, bedding with plants, hedging. Rear garden in lawn, paved patio area, shrubs, tree. Side entrance."
      },
